"tested with:"
msgstr ""

#.  no && because of a possible error
#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/prog/python-dependencies/markdown.xml:98
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>python3 -m venv --system-site-packages testenv &amp;&amp;\n"
"source testenv/bin/activate                    &amp;&amp;\n"
"pip3 install coverage                          &amp;&amp;\n"
"python3 /usr/bin/pytest --ignore=tests/test_syntax/extensions/test_md_in_html.py\n"
"deactivate</userinput>"
msgstr ""

#.  https://github.com/Python-Markdown/markdown/issues/1547 was for 3.14,
#.       and the security changes were backported to 3.13.6.
#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/prog/python-dependencies/markdown.xml:105
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Two tests in the "
"<filename>tests/test_syntax/blocks/test_html_blocks.py</filename> file are "
"known to fail due to changes in Python-3.13.6 and later's HTML Parser "
"module."
msgstr ""

